mktorrent creates BitTorrent metainfo (.torrent) files.

Build and install:

    cmake -B build
    cmake --build build
    cmake --install build --prefix /usr/local

Run tests (uses the vendored Unity in external/):

    cmake -B build -DBUILD_TESTS=ON
    cmake --build build
    ctest --test-dir build

For build options look in CMakeLists.txt.
See https://github.com/pobrn/mktorrent/wiki for more info.
